<section id="testimoni" class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24 bg-gray-50 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-green-50 to-transparent opacity-50 pointer-events-none transform -skew-x-12 translate-x-20" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="bg-green-100 text-sob-green font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 inline-block">100% Real Testimoni</span>
      <h2 class="mt-2 mb-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Apa Kata Pelanggan Kami?</h2>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 text-yellow-400">
        <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
        <span class="text-gray-900 font-black ml-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">4.9</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 font-medium mt-2">Ulasan asli pelanggan di Google Maps</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-100 shadow-soft hover-card relative group">
        <div class="absolute top-8 right-8 text-green-50 group-hover:text-green-100 transition-colors duration-300 z-0"><i class="fas fa-quote-right text-5xl sm:text-6xl"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-yellow-400 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm relative z-10">
          <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 italic mb-8 leading-relaxed relative z-10 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">"Belanja disini enak banget guyss, persediaan lengkap, harganya oke dan brngnyaa selalu ready. Apalagi melayani pesan anterr sampe kerumahh ituu membantu bgt sii. Sukses teruss SOB 😊😊"</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 relative z-10 border-t border-gray-50 pt-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 bg-pink-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl shadow-md">I</div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base">Indahsari Irviani</h5>
            <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium"><i class="fab fa-google text-blue-500 mr-1"></i> Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-100 shadow-soft hover-card relative group">
        <div class="absolute top-8 right-8 text-orange-50 group-hover:text-orange-100 transition-colors duration-300 z-0"><i class="fas fa-quote-right text-5xl sm:text-6xl"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-yellow-400 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm relative z-10">
          <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 italic mb-8 leading-relaxed relative z-10 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">"Ada layanan pesan antar, dan layanan pesan ambil. Sangat membantu. Sukses untuk SOB, belanja sayur sekarang gak perlu repot ke luar rumah."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 relative z-10 border-t border-gray-50 pt-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 bg-sob-orange rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl shadow-md">A</div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base">Alex Sinto</h5>
            <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium"><i class="fab fa-google text-blue-500 mr-1"></i> Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-100 shadow-soft hover-card relative group">
        <div class="absolute top-8 right-8 text-blue-50 group-hover:text-blue-100 transition-colors duration-300 z-0"><i class="fas fa-quote-right text-5xl sm:text-6xl"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-yellow-400 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm relative z-10">
          <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 italic mb-8 leading-relaxed relative z-10 font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">"Pelopor belanja sayur secara online di Bantul. Sudah berdiri sejak 31 Desember 1983. Semoga semakin berkembang. Mantap mantap."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 relative z-10 border-t border-gray-50 pt-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl shadow-md">S</div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base">Sigit Eka</h5>
            <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium"><i class="fab fa-google text-blue-500 mr-1"></i> Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
